# the SMK-37 Elite: the screen, Auto, dark or light, on Setup (GLOBE) too: KNOB 8, where the FM-1 has Save (BT, the FM-1's
# SAVE, saves). The same value as the Journey page's Screen (tests/scenarios/screenlight.amb, which runs here as well)
wait 300
expect light 0
expect pfcontrast 0
tap GLOBE
wait 600
shot dark.png
turn K8 1
wait 200
expect light 1
expect dirty 1
expect pfcontrast 0
wait 2500
shot light.png
# saved, and still light after a restart
press BT
wait 600
release BT
wait 40
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 600
expect light 1
shot light_restart.png
tap GLOBE
wait 600
turn K8 -1
wait 200
expect light 0
# (packs, 1.5) a turn more: Auto, as the piece is. The eight are dark
turn K8 -1
wait 200
expect light 2
expect lit 0
turn K8 1
wait 200
expect light 0
wait 600
shot dark_again.png
# the Journey page's Screen (GLOBE twice more: KNOB 7) is the same setting
tap GLOBE
wait 300
tap GLOBE
wait 600
turn K7 1
wait 200
expect light 1
tap GLOBE
wait 600
turn K8 -1
wait 200
expect light 0
